sequenceDiagram
    participant L as Lead / 引擎
    participant DB as CommDB 队列
    participant N as 投递 lane (队列/退避/回执)
    participant C as GoalControl (串行控制边界)
    participant D as runner 的 codex app-server
    participant R as Codex runner (模型)
    L->>DB: 写指令 (pending, 带 message id)
    N->>DB: 每秒取队首, 先记一次尝试
    N->>C: deliver(message id, 正文)
    C->>D: goal/get 读状态
    alt runner 正忙 (turn 进行中)
        C->>D: turn/steer 并入当前 turn
    else runner 停驻 / 空闲
        C->>D: thread/queue/add 排队
        C->>D: goal/set active 续跑
    end
    D->>R: 起 turn / 并入 turn
    D-->>C: item/started userMessage [fw-msg id]
    C-->>N: 回执 (id + thread + 代次)
    N->>DB: 标 finished + read_at (同一事务)
    Note over N,DB: 3 次失败 → 隔离该行 + 告警 Lead + 审计后门铃
